        <mxCell id="tactical-6" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;«raiz do agregado»&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;ServiceOrder&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;id, publicId: UUID&lt;br&gt;number: &lt;font color=&quot;#2e7d32&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;ServiceOrderNumber&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;customerId, vehicleId, mechanicId&lt;br&gt;problemDescription&lt;br&gt;status: ServiceOrderStatus&lt;br&gt;totalPrice: &lt;font color=&quot;#2e7d32&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Money&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;canProceedWithoutChanges&lt;br&gt;approvedItemRemoved&lt;hr&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;• Só muda de status pelas transições da máquina de estados; fora delas lança InvalidStatusTransitionException.&lt;br&gt;• Itens só entram e saem nos status que permitem mudança; serviço concluído não sai.&lt;br&gt;• Orçamento só é enviado com itens; o total tem limite.&lt;br&gt;• Só finaliza com todos os serviços concluídos.&lt;br&gt;• Registra os eventos de domínio, publicados no save.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;ServiceOrderRepository&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fff9b1;strokeColor=#b8a93a;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
